OL,3,GNEWSAThe penguins are noisy, the people
OL,4,Afantastic - what it takes to be an
OL,5,AAntarctic postmaster
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe part-time festival worker and
OL,8,Fartist says his days are spent sorting
OL,9,Fpostcards, processing letters and
OL,10,Farranging for the post to hitch a ride
OL,11,Fnorth on passing ships before being
OL,12,Fdistributed around the world.
